<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">

<!-- @pageTitle = Wild Horizon -->

<!-- @include "global/head.kit"-->

<body class="project-page">
    <!-- @include "global/header_nav.kit" -->

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="title-frame margins">
                <h1 class="project-title puzzle-type puzzle-auto" data-vertical-align="bottom">Wild Horizon</h1>
                <h5>The wondrous circus festival</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="vimeo-video hero-image" id="WIL1" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil1_hero-animation_fallback.jpg');padding:61.67% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246721711?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil1_hero-animation">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <!-- NOTE: tags are not present in the layout — placeholders below -->
            <div class="tags-frame margins">
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Logo</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Strategy</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Brand</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="adjectives margins">
                <p>loose</p>
                <p>imaginative</p>
                <p>playful</p>
                <p>accessible</p>
                <p>collaborative</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="intro margins">
            <h5>
                Wild Horizon Festival is a two-day circus and play festival at Philly’s Cherry Street Pier. Its first edition featured 20+ performances from local and internationally touring artists, centered around wonder, creative movement, and the freedom to play in public&nbsp;space.
            </h5>
        </section>
        <section class="content margins" id="wild-horizon">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil2_stickers.jpg" alt="Black notebook covered in Wild Horizon stickers" class="width4" id="WIL2">
            <p class="width2">
                Circus is all about balance and imbalance. An acrobat climbs high up, falls to the ground, gets back up and flies through the air again. The logo and identity embody this absurdity and&nbsp;momentum.
            </p>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil3_wristbands.jpg" alt="Wild Horizon wristbands in four colors" class="width6" id="WIL3">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil4_photo.jpg" alt="Aerialist performing on red silks" class="width3" id="WIL4">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil5_cropped-type.jpg" alt="Cropped “WILD” lettering in black on purple" class="width3" id="WIL5">
            <p class="width2">
                Many performances involve stacking, deconstructing, and rebuilding, so we utilized simple shapes to represent the artists using objects and environments available to them. They also bring a sense of play to the&nbsp;identity.
            </p>
            <div class="vimeo-video width4" id="WIL6" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil6_shapes-intro_fallback.jpg');padding:73.87% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246721713?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil6_shapes-intro">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil7_colors.jpg" alt="Grid of Wild Horizon graphics, colors, and type" class="width6" id="WIL7">
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="WIL8" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil8_big-jitter_fallback.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246721788?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil8_big-jitter">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="vimeo-video width3" id="WIL9" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil9_horizon-comps_fallback.jpg');padding:135.38% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246721714?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil9_horizon-comps">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <p class="width3">
                Dividing the shapes into sections plays into the metaphor of exploring what is possible on the other side of the horizon line, and it allows for modularity and accessibility for the Wild Horizon team to&nbsp;use.
            </p>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil10_cropped-banner.jpg" alt="“Flash Call for Artists” posters on a brick wall" class="width6" id="WIL10">
            <p class="width3">
                Bold typography and colors inspired by traditional circus festivals balance the risk-taking aspects of circus with maturity and&nbsp;elegance.
            </p>
            <div class="vimeo-video width3" id="WIL11" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil11_tickets_fallback.jpg');padding:135.38% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246721710?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil11_tickets">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil12_street-poster.jpg" alt="“Art From the Soul” street hoarding" class="width4" id="WIL12">
            <div class="vimeo-video width2" id="WIL13" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil13_small-jitter_fallback.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246721737?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil13_small-jitter">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil14_building-ad.jpg" alt="Building banner reading “Everyone”" class="width3" id="WIL14">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil15_photo-treatment-poster.jpg" alt="Poster with a treated photo of a dancer" class="width3" id="WIL15">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil16_pole-banners.jpg" alt="Wild Horizon pole banners on a street lamp" class="width4" id="WIL16">
            <p class="width2">
                Wild Horizon reduced the boundary between a six-year-old and a world-class juggler. Being a free event open to all was important to the team, reclaiming public spaces for joy, empathy, and&nbsp;art.
            </p>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil17_photo.jpg" alt="Performers lying on painted bleachers" class="width2" id="WIL17">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil18_wayfinding-decals.jpg" alt="Wayfinding decals on the Cherry Street Pier sign" class="width4" id="WIL18">
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="WIL19" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil19_website-demo_fallback.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246721787?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil19_website-demo">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <p class="width3">
                We also helped the Wild Horizon team with a website design that organizes the full program of performances by category and audience level. Easy for attendees to pick the shows they want to see and recognize the graphics live at the&nbsp;festival.
            </p>
            <div class="vimeo-video width2" id="WIL20" style="--poster:url('assets/project-pages/WIL/wil20_button-hover_fallback.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1246723655?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="wil20_button-hover">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil21_split-design.jpg" alt="“We All Own the Public” poster" class="width3" id="WIL21">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil22_weatpaste.jpg" alt="Wild Horizon wheatpaste poster on a weathered wall" class="width3" id="WIL22">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/WIL/wil23_summary-graphic.jpg" alt="Collage of Wild Horizon graphics, posters, and festival photos" class="width6" id="WIL23">
        </section>
        <!-- @include "global/components/next-project.kit" -->

        <!-- @include "global/footer.kit" -->


    </main>
    <!-- @import "global/scripts.kit"-->

</body>

</html>
